The manifest records no codec per column: under `tessera-table-v2` it is a function of the column's dtype (SPEC
§5b). `--encodings` reads each table block's payload and lists the Vortex encodings it stores per column.

```
$ tessera inspect ../../corpus/files/table_v2_dtypes.tsra --encodings
